  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Multi-modal messages, agent loop, embeddings, middleware, MCP, image generation, speech & telemetry (b012d808 / PR #1)\nA major feature release covering the following areas:\nMulti-modal Support\n• Added ContentPart model to support text, image, and other content types within a single message.\n• Extended Message to carry multi-part content.\nAgent Loop\n• Introduced AiClient with a built-in agent loop for multi-step, tool-augmented generation via GenerateTextResult and StepResult.\n• Added GenerateTextOptions for fine-grained control over generation behaviour.\nEmbeddings\n• New embedding models for Azure OpenAI, Cohere, Google, Mistral, and OpenAI.\n• Accompanying embedding model enumerations (AzureOpenAIEmbeddingModels, CohereEmbeddingModels, GoogleEmbeddingModels, MistralEmbeddingModels, OpenAIEmbeddingModels).\nMiddleware Pipeline\n• New ILanguageModelMiddleware abstraction for composable request/response interception.\n• Built-in CachingMiddleware and LoggingMiddleware implementations.\n• MiddlewareLanguageModel wrapper and LanguageModelExtensions for easy pipeline composition.\nMCP (Model Context Protocol)\n• Added IMcpClient, McpToolDefinition, and McpToolProvider for integrating MCP-compatible tool sources into the agent loop.\nImage Generation & Speech\n• OpenAIImageGenerationModel — generate images via OpenAI's image API.\n• OpenAISpeechModel — text-to-speech via OpenAI.\n• OpenAITranscriptionModel and ITranscriptionModel interface for audio transcription.\nReranking\n• CohereRerankModel and IRerankModel interface for document reranking workflows.\nProvider Registry & Factories\n• Added IProviderFactory and ProviderRegistry for centralised provider management.\n• New provider/factory classes for Azure OpenAI, Cohere, Google, Mistral, and OpenAI.\nTool Execution\n• Added IToolExecutor interface for structured tool invocation within the agent loop.\nTelemetry\n• Added AiSdkActivitySource providing OpenTelemetry-compatible activity tracing for SDK operations.",
